1
00:00:02,540 --> 00:00:04,630
Acceleration Mode... on!

2
00:00:08,710 --> 00:00:10,130
What the hell was that, dude?!

3
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:11,580
Shit!

4
00:00:15,670 --> 00:00:16,380
Oh crap!

5
00:00:17,130 --> 00:00:20,420
Then all you have to do... is let 
it fall right into the basket.

6
00:00:30,670 --> 00:00:33,040
Hoo boy, they've really 
got us on the ropes now!

7
00:00:33,040 --> 00:00:35,290
Don't make it sound like we've already lost!

8
00:00:35,290 --> 00:00:36,790
We're just getting started! Isn't that right?

9
00:00:36,790 --> 00:00:39,920
We're in a tight spot, 
I'm not sure what to do.

10
00:00:40,210 --> 00:00:42,040
I guess maybe we should 
put Taro on the bench.

11
00:00:42,040 --> 00:00:44,750
I can hear you from over here, damn geezer!

12
00:00:45,250 --> 00:00:47,040
Just shut up and watch.

13
00:00:47,040 --> 00:00:50,250
Forget that shorty, I'm gonna 
fly past their whole team!

14
00:00:50,460 --> 00:00:52,250
Oh crap, now he's even more wound up.

15
00:00:52,670 --> 00:00:55,460
He's gonna go on a rampage 
soon, there's no doubt.

16
00:00:55,670 --> 00:00:58,290
And I keep telling you, 
that's exactly what we want.

17
00:00:58,420 --> 00:00:59,170
Huh?

18
00:01:00,630 --> 00:01:05,210
We're going to have Taro...
trample all over that kid's tiny wings.

19
00:01:29,170 --> 00:01:35,250
Ahiru no Sora

20
00:02:38,790 --> 00:02:39,920
Kitasumi!

21
00:02:40,130 --> 00:02:41,540
Let's score!

22
00:02:40,710 --> 00:02:41,540
Here they come!

23
00:02:40,960 --> 00:02:44,380
Versus

24
00:02:41,540 --> 00:02:42,540
Kitasumi!

25
00:02:42,540 --> 00:02:43,580
Let's score!

26
00:02:42,540 --> 00:02:44,380
Yasuhara, watch out for any passes!

27
00:02:43,580 --> 00:02:44,380
Kitasumi!

28
00:02:44,380 --> 00:02:45,880
Let's score!

29
00:03:02,750 --> 00:03:04,500
Defensive foul, #4!

30
00:03:04,880 --> 00:03:05,920
Two free-throws!

31
00:03:05,920 --> 00:03:08,630
Dammit. She called a foul on me?

32
00:03:09,170 --> 00:03:11,920
Hey, Yasuhara. Don't drop 
your hands like that.

33
00:03:12,330 --> 00:03:14,250
Blocking passes from above 
is an absolute must.

34
00:03:14,250 --> 00:03:14,920
Okay.

35
00:03:19,420 --> 00:03:21,500
Awesome! He nailed both of those free-throws!

36
00:03:21,960 --> 00:03:23,130
Keep it up, Konishi!

37
00:03:31,040 --> 00:03:32,420
T-T-T-Taro?!

38
00:03:32,420 --> 00:03:34,330
No way, is he also doing...?

39
00:03:34,670 --> 00:03:36,630
Full court man-to-man?!

40
00:03:37,670 --> 00:03:40,880
Whenever someone puts me through shit,
I never sit and take it.

41
00:03:41,920 --> 00:03:45,040
Starting now, I'll give you 
a taste of your own medicine!

42
00:03:45,420 --> 00:03:46,500
Here we go again...

43
00:03:46,500 --> 00:03:48,420
He always tries to get even.

44
00:03:48,790 --> 00:03:49,960
Ouch...

45
00:03:49,960 --> 00:03:51,830
Why the heck did you hit me?!

46
00:03:51,830 --> 00:03:53,920
Because you hit me first!

47
00:03:55,380 --> 00:03:57,080
I said I was sorry!

48
00:03:57,080 --> 00:03:58,960
Suffer the pain that I did!

49
00:03:59,960 --> 00:04:02,790
He's the most hardheaded idiot, I swear.

50
00:04:02,790 --> 00:04:05,130
Always dishing it out, but 
can never take it himself.

51
00:04:05,330 --> 00:04:07,420
Okay. Let's play cat and mouse then.

52
00:04:08,380 --> 00:04:10,080
I'm not gonna let him get the better of me!

53
00:04:11,130 --> 00:04:13,040
Dumbass! Don't let him provoke you!

54
00:04:13,040 --> 00:04:14,960
You won't even last half the game like that!

55
00:04:15,130 --> 00:04:16,880
Chill out, just leave him be.

56
00:04:17,580 --> 00:04:19,920
This actually works in our favor.

57
00:04:23,130 --> 00:04:26,290
Just so you know, my heart 
runs on pure horsepower!

58
00:04:26,290 --> 00:04:27,580
"Pure horsepower"...?

59
00:04:27,580 --> 00:04:30,040
Nobody outruns me!

60
00:04:31,920 --> 00:04:33,000
Sora?

61
00:04:33,710 --> 00:04:35,580
Are you still sulking about it?

62
00:04:36,170 --> 00:04:38,790
This isn't new, you've 
always been a bench player.

63
00:04:38,790 --> 00:04:40,960
I'm sick of it, this is discrimination!

64
00:04:41,170 --> 00:04:43,920
It's like saying short kids 
aren't allowed to play!

65
00:04:43,920 --> 00:04:45,130
Don't be ridiculous.

66
00:04:45,460 --> 00:04:49,330
I'm dead serious! That coach has never once
put me in an actual game!

67
00:04:49,920 --> 00:04:52,750
How did you compare to everyone
in the last training session?

68
00:04:52,750 --> 00:04:54,540
They already announced the results, right?

69
00:04:54,630 --> 00:04:56,630
You're looking at the number one overall!

70
00:04:56,880 --> 00:04:59,960
Even in the dribble marathon? 
And the 50-meter dash?

71
00:04:59,960 --> 00:05:01,290
Of course!

72
00:05:05,460 --> 00:05:07,830
But nothing changed, I'm 
still treated the same.

73
00:05:08,330 --> 00:05:10,210
It makes me hate everything.

74
00:05:10,670 --> 00:05:12,130
And what about the endurance marathon?

75
00:05:13,920 --> 00:05:15,130
Well, I was...

76
00:05:15,750 --> 00:05:18,130
...only 4th. No, actually 5th.

77
00:05:18,330 --> 00:05:21,040
But what does that have to 
do with basketball anyway?

78
00:05:22,330 --> 00:05:24,460
It doesn't matter how fast 
you can run if you can't

79
00:05:24,460 --> 00:05:26,840
keep it up for an extended 
period of time, right?

80
00:05:27,170 --> 00:05:29,380
Basketball games last for 40 minutes.

81
00:05:29,380 --> 00:05:32,670
Dashing around the court
for that whole time is incredibly taxing.

82
00:05:41,040 --> 00:05:44,250
Having stamina and speed is 
vital for any short player.

83
00:05:44,500 --> 00:05:46,980
But becoming the most capable 
runner on a team is only

84
00:05:46,980 --> 00:05:49,680
half of what they need to 
be considered good, I'd say.

85
00:05:51,380 --> 00:05:54,170
Then... what's the other half?

86
00:05:56,080 --> 00:05:57,210
That's simple.

87
00:05:59,130 --> 00:06:02,960
Becoming the most capable runner
who plays out on the court, silly.

88
00:06:03,460 --> 00:06:05,330
Taro is actually having 
trouble keeping up with him!

89
00:06:05,330 --> 00:06:08,290
Even though that shrimp
has already been running for 10 minutes!

90
00:06:10,330 --> 00:06:13,170
It'll take way more than 
that to stop our boy.

91
00:06:13,710 --> 00:06:15,540
And since the other team 
is doing man-to-man...

92
00:06:16,460 --> 00:06:19,460
...we can easily spread their defense apart.

93
00:06:21,000 --> 00:06:24,170
But more than anything,
I wanna make that seaweed haired punk cry!

94
00:06:32,750 --> 00:06:33,670
They're charging in!

95
00:06:33,670 --> 00:06:34,630
Help!

96
00:06:34,630 --> 00:06:36,130
I don't need any help!

97
00:06:36,330 --> 00:06:38,630
I'll shut him down myself!

98
00:06:43,880 --> 00:06:45,880
Damn you!

99
00:06:52,670 --> 00:06:53,420
Rebound!

100
00:06:53,420 --> 00:06:54,380
From out here?!

101
00:06:56,080 --> 00:06:58,630
Why?! How did that shot go in?!

102
00:06:58,960 --> 00:07:00,080
A 5-point lead!

103
00:06:58,960 --> 00:07:02,170
Kitasumiyoshi

104
00:06:58,960 --> 00:07:02,170
Kuzuryu

105
00:07:00,080 --> 00:07:02,130
We're leaving them in the dust!

106
00:07:02,250 --> 00:07:05,830
Come on, Taro! Just let Konishi
handle all of the rebounds!

107
00:07:05,830 --> 00:07:07,130
SHUT YOUR FACE!

108
00:07:08,040 --> 00:07:11,750
But wow, it must be exhausting for that guy
to switch to full-court defense now.

109
00:07:13,710 --> 00:07:16,380
Sheesh! He's just wasting energy
with all those pointless moves.

110
00:07:16,380 --> 00:07:19,330
Oh, wait! Is that why you 
gave Taro a hard time, Coach?

111
00:07:19,500 --> 00:07:21,750
You got him all wound 
up on purpose and now...

112
00:07:21,750 --> 00:07:22,790
Not yet.

113
00:07:23,290 --> 00:07:26,670
He's not done, we've only 
just gotten started.

114
00:07:27,250 --> 00:07:28,710
The other team is using zone defense!

115
00:07:29,170 --> 00:07:30,630
Let's try and hit 'em before they set it up!

116
00:07:30,830 --> 00:07:33,670
He's too clingy! Damn squirt!

117
00:07:36,380 --> 00:07:38,580
I've had just about enough of this bullshit!

118
00:07:38,710 --> 00:07:39,460
Taro?!

119
00:07:39,460 --> 00:07:40,290
Huh?!

120
00:07:41,040 --> 00:07:42,210
He went to the back court?!

121
00:07:42,880 --> 00:07:44,630
How should I react to that?

122
00:07:45,170 --> 00:07:46,330
Should I prioritize the ball?

123
00:07:46,920 --> 00:07:49,960
No, my job is man-to-man,
and that means I have to stick with him!

124
00:07:50,290 --> 00:07:51,250
Dumbass!

125
00:07:51,250 --> 00:07:52,960
Don't waste energy chasing after him!

126
00:07:52,960 --> 00:07:55,080
They won't bother passing to him either way!

127
00:07:59,330 --> 00:08:01,880
Holy shit! That was a 
sick move he just pulled!

128
00:08:01,880 --> 00:08:04,790
Yeah it was cool, but also looked like
a total waste of effort.

129
00:08:04,790 --> 00:08:07,750
You can't touch this! I dare you to even try!

130
00:08:07,960 --> 00:08:09,000
Konishi, head for the middle!

131
00:08:09,000 --> 00:08:10,580
He's going for it, Yasu! 
Don't let him through!

132
00:08:10,580 --> 00:08:11,290
Pass it here!

133
00:08:11,500 --> 00:08:13,250
Man, his legs just won't stop!

134
00:08:13,380 --> 00:08:15,080
I can't believe how athletic Kabachi is!

135
00:08:15,630 --> 00:08:18,630
But no matter what, I can't 
let him score any more points!

136
00:08:19,710 --> 00:08:20,750
In the paint!

137
00:08:25,580 --> 00:08:26,500
Dammit!

138
00:08:27,960 --> 00:08:29,130
He's totally blocked!

139
00:08:31,000 --> 00:08:32,040
He moved!

140
00:08:32,040 --> 00:08:33,500
He took a step!

141
00:08:33,880 --> 00:08:34,790
Travelling!

142
00:08:34,790 --> 00:08:37,920
Shoot, that was so close!
We managed to get it all the way in the paint!

143
00:08:37,920 --> 00:08:41,460
This is nuts. It's almost like
Taro is superhuman with all his moves!

144
00:08:41,750 --> 00:08:45,170
I sure as hell wouldn't last a 
quarter trying to defend him.

145
00:08:46,580 --> 00:08:48,130
Kurumatani...

146
00:08:48,790 --> 00:08:51,040
Kuzu High ball! Throw-in!

147
00:09:00,380 --> 00:09:02,210
Oh, these feel really nice.

148
00:09:02,210 --> 00:09:04,250
They were worth the high price.

149
00:09:04,250 --> 00:09:06,130
I better put them to good use!

150
00:09:08,960 --> 00:09:10,210
Is somebody else here?

151
00:09:13,540 --> 00:09:14,710
Hey, Chiba.

152
00:09:15,960 --> 00:09:16,630
Yo.

153
00:09:16,630 --> 00:09:18,420
What are you doing here?

154
00:09:18,420 --> 00:09:19,960
We have today off, you know.

155
00:09:19,960 --> 00:09:21,500
Don't give me that.

156
00:09:21,500 --> 00:09:24,040
Nobody would agree to go 
to the movies with me.

157
00:09:24,040 --> 00:09:25,540
And I hate going by myself.

158
00:09:28,290 --> 00:09:32,250
And what about you? I thought you were
going to a studio or something.

159
00:09:32,250 --> 00:09:34,540
I ran into some surprises on my way there.

160
00:09:34,540 --> 00:09:35,540
Surprises?

161
00:09:39,540 --> 00:09:40,710
All of a sudden...

162
00:09:41,630 --> 00:09:44,000
...I really started craving 
to play basketball.

163
00:09:44,000 --> 00:09:45,000
Huh?

164
00:09:45,000 --> 00:09:46,630
The inter-high preliminaries...

165
00:09:47,330 --> 00:09:50,420
...I think we're in for a ride 
right from the get-go this year.

166
00:09:51,080 --> 00:09:53,460
Something's got him unusually pumped up.

167
00:09:55,540 --> 00:09:56,830
Hey, Tokiwa?

168
00:09:57,330 --> 00:09:59,000
Mind if I ask you a question?

169
00:09:59,290 --> 00:10:00,210
What is it?

170
00:10:00,420 --> 00:10:03,000
Do you think joining a band 
would net me a girlfriend?

171
00:10:04,830 --> 00:10:06,580
Quit joking around with me.

172
00:10:07,330 --> 00:10:08,290
Okay, then...

173
00:10:10,000 --> 00:10:11,250
Foul, #5 on defense!

174
00:10:11,250 --> 00:10:13,330
What the hell? I didn't hit him!

175
00:10:13,330 --> 00:10:14,830
I just gave him a bit of a shove!

176
00:10:14,830 --> 00:10:16,670
Pushing is a foul, dude.

177
00:10:16,880 --> 00:10:19,540
Yasuhara, that's your 
third foul in this game.

178
00:10:19,540 --> 00:10:20,750
You gotta be more careful.

179
00:10:20,750 --> 00:10:22,790
Goddammit, stupid Yabuuchi.

180
00:10:22,790 --> 00:10:25,250
She just keeps blowing that 
annoying whistle on me.

181
00:10:25,380 --> 00:10:27,250
Hold up, maybe it's cuz 
she's got the hots for me.

182
00:10:27,500 --> 00:10:28,210
As if!

183
00:10:28,960 --> 00:10:31,920
Kuzuryu

184
00:10:28,960 --> 00:10:31,920
Kitasumiyoshi

185
00:10:32,210 --> 00:10:35,420
They're already halfway through
the third quarter of the game...

186
00:10:35,580 --> 00:10:38,500
...but they've managed to fend off
a Kitasumi comeback this whole time.

187
00:10:39,920 --> 00:10:43,630
That's solid proof of how 
effective Sora is on defense.

188
00:10:44,540 --> 00:10:46,830
He really does run like nobody else.

189
00:10:49,500 --> 00:10:50,500
That shot is off!

190
00:10:50,710 --> 00:10:52,080
It's going to come down near you, Momoharu!

191
00:10:52,080 --> 00:10:52,790
Rebound!

192
00:10:53,460 --> 00:10:54,710
I know already!

193
00:10:57,380 --> 00:11:00,330
That bastard... he just 
straight up smacked my hand!

194
00:11:00,330 --> 00:11:01,420
Here they come again!

195
00:11:01,420 --> 00:11:02,580
Watch the inside!

196
00:11:07,670 --> 00:11:08,580
Crap!

197
00:11:08,580 --> 00:11:11,420
Good job! I can hear the 
basket calling my name!

198
00:11:16,790 --> 00:11:17,750
Badass!

199
00:11:17,750 --> 00:11:18,880
Nice, Kite!

200
00:11:20,130 --> 00:11:22,750
Out of bounds! Kitasumi ball!

201
00:11:23,670 --> 00:11:25,330
He totally abandoned his zone just now.

202
00:11:25,330 --> 00:11:27,330
What the heck was that guy thinking?

203
00:11:27,330 --> 00:11:28,880
That's what I want to know...

204
00:11:29,170 --> 00:11:30,210
This cocky punk.

205
00:11:30,210 --> 00:11:33,380
I'm getting sick of standing
in the same damn place the whole game!

206
00:11:33,750 --> 00:11:35,420
Zone really just isn't my thing.

207
00:11:35,830 --> 00:11:39,670
When that pass came at me,
I know for sure that guy was in the paint.

208
00:11:42,330 --> 00:11:44,830
Does that guy just move at 
the speed of light or what?

209
00:11:45,250 --> 00:11:46,000
And even worse...

210
00:11:46,540 --> 00:11:48,670
...he's got the edge on 
me in the cool department!

211
00:11:48,670 --> 00:11:49,880
Thanks a bunch, Kite!

212
00:11:50,130 --> 00:11:52,250
Sorry you had to take a risk to cover for me.

213
00:11:52,250 --> 00:11:56,130
But if you hadn't done anything,
then Kabachi would have definitely scored on us.

214
00:11:56,670 --> 00:11:59,080
Whatever, I didn't do it to help you out.

215
00:11:59,540 --> 00:12:01,880
I did it because I figured 
it would work, that's all.

216
00:12:02,710 --> 00:12:03,880
Anyway...

217
00:12:03,880 --> 00:12:05,790
...don't get caught by any 
more of their lame screens.

218
00:12:06,170 --> 00:12:08,290
What happened? Are you already tapped out?

219
00:12:08,460 --> 00:12:11,170
Nope. I could keep running 
for another 100 years!

220
00:12:12,880 --> 00:12:14,420
They're focused in the middle!

221
00:12:14,420 --> 00:12:15,540
Throw them off with some passes!

222
00:12:16,170 --> 00:12:18,790
Konishi, keep your eyes on the shot clock!

223
00:12:18,790 --> 00:12:19,880
Kitasumi!

224
00:12:19,880 --> 00:12:21,000
Let's score!

225
00:12:21,000 --> 00:12:21,790
Kitasumi!

226
00:12:21,790 --> 00:12:23,290
Let's score! Uh...

227
00:12:22,210 --> 00:12:23,290
Let's score!

228
00:12:23,290 --> 00:12:24,460
Defense!
Kitasumi!

229
00:12:24,460 --> 00:12:25,670
Let's score!

230
00:12:24,460 --> 00:12:27,380
Kato! Over here! Gimmie the 
ball! Ball! Kato! Ball!

231
00:12:25,670 --> 00:12:26,670
Kitasumi!

232
00:12:26,670 --> 00:12:27,380
Let's score!

233
00:12:27,380 --> 00:12:29,380
Get rid of your defender first!

234
00:12:29,710 --> 00:12:31,670
I can't let fatigue get the better of me.

235
00:12:31,670 --> 00:12:33,630
I have to hold him back no matter what!

236
00:12:34,250 --> 00:12:37,080
I've practiced how to play 
defense ever since I was little!

237
00:12:37,580 --> 00:12:40,040
I've learned everything and anything
that doesn't require height!

238
00:12:40,420 --> 00:12:43,580
So that I could become the one
who runs on the court the most!

239
00:12:43,960 --> 00:12:46,000
Hasebe, don't risk it! Pass it back!

240
00:12:52,670 --> 00:12:53,540
A steal!

241
00:12:53,540 --> 00:12:54,330
What?!

242
00:12:55,580 --> 00:12:56,790
H-he's quick!

243
00:12:56,790 --> 00:12:59,170
That shrimp is gonna take 
it all the way by himself!

244
00:13:00,460 --> 00:13:02,460
Go!

245
00:13:11,130 --> 00:13:12,790
We're gonna be celebrating tonight!

246
00:13:12,790 --> 00:13:13,790
Shit!

247
00:13:13,790 --> 00:13:15,750
Forget about it. Just stay focused.

248
00:13:16,630 --> 00:13:18,500
Never thought he'd last this long.

249
00:13:19,290 --> 00:13:22,080
I gotta admit, even I'm a little surprised.

250
00:13:23,420 --> 00:13:24,670
But it's fine...

251
00:13:25,080 --> 00:13:27,250
...the gap is about to start 
getting wider and wider.

252
00:13:27,380 --> 00:13:29,790
Katori! We're counting on 
you for some solid passing!

253
00:13:29,790 --> 00:13:30,830
Find a way through them!

254
00:13:35,040 --> 00:13:36,000
Huh?

255
00:13:36,790 --> 00:13:39,670
Am I crazy or did Kabachi just 
get faster all of a sudden?

256
00:13:40,920 --> 00:13:43,960
Impossible. Does that mean he's been
holding back this whole time?

257
00:13:44,710 --> 00:13:47,460
No, he doesn't look capable 
of something that shrewd.

258
00:13:47,750 --> 00:13:49,000
It must be my imagination.

259
00:13:51,750 --> 00:13:53,920
I'm wrong! He's definitely getting faster!

260
00:13:55,540 --> 00:13:58,710
We've been at this for more
than 20 minutes straight now... so how?!

261
00:14:01,290 --> 00:14:03,080
All right, Kato! Gimme that ball!

262
00:14:05,540 --> 00:14:08,380
Is it actually me... who's getting slower?!

263
00:14:14,210 --> 00:14:14,880
Help!

264
00:14:14,880 --> 00:14:15,960
Kato! Pass it inside!

265
00:14:17,080 --> 00:14:19,750
That stupid shrimp!
Did he forget why he's doing man-to-man?!

266
00:14:19,750 --> 00:14:21,130
Dammit!

267
00:14:21,420 --> 00:14:23,170
How can this guy be so quick on the shot?!

268
00:14:27,000 --> 00:14:28,130
He did it!

269
00:14:28,290 --> 00:14:30,210
That was awesome, Senpai!

270
00:14:30,630 --> 00:14:33,580
You stupid shrimp! Don't just 
let him run free like that!

271
00:14:33,580 --> 00:14:36,540
Sorry! The sun totally got in my eyes and...

272
00:14:39,630 --> 00:14:40,920
Player substitution!

273
00:14:43,170 --> 00:14:44,290
I'm out?

274
00:14:45,880 --> 00:14:47,330
Kuzuryu

275
00:14:45,880 --> 00:14:47,330
Kitasumiyoshi

276
00:14:45,880 --> 00:14:48,540
Uh, wait, no! Hold on!

277
00:14:48,540 --> 00:14:50,080
You don't need to sub me out!

278
00:14:50,080 --> 00:14:51,830
I'm not even feeling tired, I swear!

279
00:14:52,040 --> 00:14:54,420
I can whistle a tune 
totally fine, just watch!

280
00:14:55,790 --> 00:14:57,960
Sorry! Please call off the substitution!

281
00:14:57,960 --> 00:14:59,210
Listen, Kurumatani.

282
00:14:59,790 --> 00:15:01,630
You're subbing out for Chucky.

283
00:15:03,250 --> 00:15:05,830
This is... a direct order from your coach.

284
00:15:08,830 --> 00:15:10,210
The tide is turning!

285
00:15:10,210 --> 00:15:12,130
Let's score one after the other until we win!

286
00:15:12,830 --> 00:15:26,670
Defense! Defense! Defense!

287
00:15:22,290 --> 00:15:24,380
Well, well. Hmph.

288
00:15:24,380 --> 00:15:26,670
He really held in there.

289
00:15:26,670 --> 00:15:29,130
Chucky, you're looking really stiff.

290
00:15:29,130 --> 00:15:31,130
We're gonna pass the ball 
around, so just take it easy.

291
00:15:31,130 --> 00:15:32,290
R-right!

292
00:15:32,460 --> 00:15:33,750
Pass the ball, I got it!

293
00:15:33,750 --> 00:15:37,880
P-pass, pass, pass, pass, pass, 
pass... pass... pa... ss...

294
00:15:41,500 --> 00:15:43,170
Don't hold on to it for too long.

295
00:15:43,170 --> 00:15:44,130
Okay!

296
00:15:47,630 --> 00:15:48,580
Loose ball!

297
00:15:48,580 --> 00:15:49,540
It's a turnover!

298
00:15:56,540 --> 00:15:57,830
S-sorry guys!

299
00:15:57,830 --> 00:15:59,630
No prob, shake it off!

300
00:15:59,630 --> 00:16:01,710
Damn. We can't make a fast break.

301
00:16:01,710 --> 00:16:16,540
Offense! Offense! Offense!

302
00:16:03,170 --> 00:16:04,830
Listen up, everybody!

303
00:16:04,830 --> 00:16:06,980
Just stick to our zone defense!

304
00:16:06,980 --> 00:16:10,440
And Chucky, you go man-to-man 
with #7 starting from half-court!

305
00:16:10,460 --> 00:16:13,020
Be sure to deny him any passes, Chucky!

306
00:16:13,020 --> 00:16:14,910
We can't let them move 
the ball into the paint!

307
00:16:14,920 --> 00:16:16,540
Roger! I'm all over it!

308
00:16:18,630 --> 00:16:20,920
They got the ball through to him in no time!

309
00:16:20,920 --> 00:16:22,380
What's the deal with their #6?

310
00:16:22,830 --> 00:16:26,290
Shit, I finally get free of 
the little boy and now this.

311
00:16:26,290 --> 00:16:30,290
I ran myself ragged practicing how to do defense!
I won't let him past me!

312
00:16:35,670 --> 00:16:36,710
T-too fast!

313
00:16:36,710 --> 00:16:38,290
Nice move, Taro!

314
00:16:38,290 --> 00:16:39,880
Their defense is full of holes!

315
00:16:39,880 --> 00:16:40,920
Slippery bastard!

316
00:16:49,880 --> 00:16:51,880
He totally left me in the dust...

317
00:16:53,630 --> 00:16:57,000
And our shorty was keeping up
with that guy this whole time?!

318
00:16:57,000 --> 00:16:59,250
This is nuts. He's on a 
totally different level!

319
00:16:59,250 --> 00:17:01,170
I wanna swap with somebody else!

320
00:17:01,170 --> 00:17:14,460
Kitasumi! Fight! Kitasumi! Fight!

321
00:17:05,880 --> 00:17:08,880
Please provide each other with cover
if they break through to the center!

322
00:17:08,880 --> 00:17:10,960
Be very careful when they're in low post!

323
00:17:11,380 --> 00:17:14,460
Get on #7! Our defense 
in the paint is lacking!

324
00:17:15,040 --> 00:17:26,420
Defense! Defense! Defense!

325
00:17:18,960 --> 00:17:20,460
Goddammit...

326
00:17:20,460 --> 00:17:21,500
Goddammit!

327
00:17:22,210 --> 00:17:25,250
I can keep going! I know I can still run!

328
00:17:25,250 --> 00:17:26,420
Dammit!

329
00:17:26,790 --> 00:17:29,630
Hang in there, this is 
the time to be tenacious.

330
00:17:31,080 --> 00:17:33,380
It's too early to get upset, don't you think?

331
00:17:33,880 --> 00:17:36,130
We're still a long way from losing this game.

332
00:17:36,380 --> 00:17:37,710
The game...

333
00:17:37,710 --> 00:17:39,710
Anyway, is your knee feeling okay?

334
00:17:40,500 --> 00:17:41,540
My knee?

335
00:17:42,210 --> 00:17:45,710
You stumbled earlier,
and I thought maybe you'd been injured...

336
00:17:46,000 --> 00:17:48,210
Why's that? I'm totally fine!

337
00:17:48,210 --> 00:17:49,170
Really?

338
00:17:49,170 --> 00:17:52,080
I've been running like that my whole life,
and never even broken a bone!

339
00:17:52,080 --> 00:17:52,750
Look!

340
00:17:54,920 --> 00:17:55,960
I'm so glad!

341
00:17:58,080 --> 00:18:00,170
For right now, you should 
focus on resting up.

342
00:18:03,330 --> 00:18:04,960
Damn you! Hiyah!

343
00:18:06,500 --> 00:18:08,880
Defensive foul! #5!

344
00:18:10,330 --> 00:18:12,790
Hey! Isn't their #5 already 
on his fourth foul?

345
00:18:12,790 --> 00:18:15,000
Sweet! It's still only the third quarter!

346
00:18:16,290 --> 00:18:18,670
Timeout by Kuzuryu High!

347
00:18:21,460 --> 00:18:24,630
Yasuhara, I told you to be 
more careful with the fouls!

348
00:18:24,630 --> 00:18:25,750
Sorry.

349
00:18:25,750 --> 00:18:27,670
Do you WANT to get ejected 
from the game again?

350
00:18:28,460 --> 00:18:32,920
Out of our three noobs,
Yasu is the only one who can dribble decently.

351
00:18:32,920 --> 00:18:34,960
Losing him now would hurt quite a bit.

352
00:18:35,380 --> 00:18:36,500
Hey, Nanao.

353
00:18:37,750 --> 00:18:40,250
Don't you think we should 
switch up our defense?

354
00:18:40,250 --> 00:18:43,460
With Tinytown on the bench,
there's no point in keeping up a zone D.

355
00:18:43,750 --> 00:18:47,830
Except we haven't been using zone D
solely for the benefit of Tinytown.

356
00:18:48,710 --> 00:18:51,090
If we do man-to-man there's 
a strong possibility

357
00:18:51,090 --> 00:18:53,860
that Yasu and Chucky will 
get overwhelmed in a 1-on-1.

358
00:18:54,580 --> 00:18:58,750
One reason we chose zone D is to fortify
our ability to help and recover when necessary.

359
00:18:58,750 --> 00:19:00,330
Isn't that right, Nao?

360
00:19:00,330 --> 00:19:01,210
Exactly!

361
00:19:01,920 --> 00:19:05,580
For the time being, we'll have 
Yasuhara sub out for Nabe.

362
00:19:05,920 --> 00:19:06,880
Sure.

363
00:19:06,880 --> 00:19:09,190
As for our defense, we'll 
switch to the 2-3 zone,

364
00:19:09,190 --> 00:19:11,190
which is the very first 
formation we practiced.

365
00:19:11,190 --> 00:19:13,500
You remember how to do that, right Nabe?

366
00:19:13,500 --> 00:19:14,790
Uh, yeah, I think so!

367
00:19:14,790 --> 00:19:16,630
Wait just a sec, Nao!

368
00:19:16,630 --> 00:19:19,080
Could I... sub out for somebody, too?

369
00:19:19,380 --> 00:19:21,080
Huh? What do you mean?

370
00:19:21,080 --> 00:19:23,290
I mean, Tinytown is ready to go right?

371
00:19:23,290 --> 00:19:25,500
I'm like... already...

372
00:19:38,210 --> 00:19:40,750
Man, the look in his eyes is so intense...

373
00:19:41,040 --> 00:19:44,420
And that's how he looks
after running for nearly 30 minutes straight?

374
00:19:44,710 --> 00:19:47,960
Meanwhile, I've only run 
for like 2 or 3 tops.

375
00:19:47,960 --> 00:19:49,130
Shit!

376
00:19:49,130 --> 00:19:50,630
What is it, Chucky?

377
00:19:50,920 --> 00:19:53,130
Nothing, forget what I just said!

378
00:19:53,130 --> 00:19:53,880
Huh?

379
00:19:53,880 --> 00:19:56,000
We don't have to change our 
zone formation, either!

380
00:19:56,460 --> 00:20:00,040
All I gotta do is put a 
stop to their #7, right?

381
00:20:01,630 --> 00:20:03,710
Until Tinytown is back in the game,

382
00:20:04,460 --> 00:20:07,920
I'll shut down #7 even if it means
I have to slug him in the face!

383
00:20:11,250 --> 00:20:13,630
He totally nailed both of those free-throws!

384
00:20:13,630 --> 00:20:15,540
That ties up the score!

385
00:20:15,830 --> 00:20:18,000
The other team is missing the guy
who was carrying them!

386
00:20:18,630 --> 00:20:20,790
Let's use this chance to take them by storm!

387
00:20:21,040 --> 00:20:29,920
Defense! Defense! Defense!

388
00:20:23,170 --> 00:20:24,460
Idiots.

389
00:20:25,670 --> 00:20:27,330
Get your heads out of your asses.

390
00:20:27,790 --> 00:20:29,920
That shorty doesn't carry our team.

391
00:20:35,170 --> 00:20:36,460
A three?!

392
00:20:45,330 --> 00:20:46,880
I'm the top scorer here.

393
00:20:47,210 --> 00:20:49,000
Just try and stop me if you can!

394
00:20:50,380 --> 00:20:51,630
Jeez, what's his problem?!

395
00:20:51,630 --> 00:20:53,420
He's really pissing me off!

396
00:20:54,250 --> 00:20:55,830
Go kick the bucket somewhere.

397
00:20:57,330 --> 00:20:58,250
Smug jerk.

398
00:20:58,250 --> 00:21:00,710
The momentum is still 
on our side, don't stop!

399
00:21:00,710 --> 00:21:02,210
Let's make sure we score the next one!

400
00:21:03,000 --> 00:21:04,580
I'm ready to sink a three-pointer!

401
00:21:04,580 --> 00:21:05,420
Gimme the ball!

402
00:21:05,420 --> 00:21:06,710
Kitasumi!

403
00:21:06,710 --> 00:21:07,960
Let's score!

404
00:21:06,710 --> 00:21:10,380
Come on, guys! Just keep 
passing the ball to Taro!

405
00:21:07,960 --> 00:21:08,880
Kitasumi!

406
00:21:08,880 --> 00:21:10,380
Let's score!

407
00:21:10,380 --> 00:21:11,460
Kitasumi!

408
00:21:11,460 --> 00:21:12,170
Let's score!

409
00:21:14,420 --> 00:21:15,750
Full-court?!

410
00:21:16,920 --> 00:21:18,580
Can their #6 really run enough to cover him?!

411
00:21:19,210 --> 00:21:21,710
Again? Give me a break.

412
00:21:22,000 --> 00:21:23,750
Chucky! Don't push yourself!

413
00:21:24,040 --> 00:21:27,420
Playing full-court D is really,
REALLY exhausting, you know!

414
00:21:27,420 --> 00:21:30,080
But Tinytown kept it up 
for a full 30 minutes.

415
00:21:30,080 --> 00:21:33,380
Lasting a measly 10 minutes 
should be a piece of cake!

416
00:21:34,250 --> 00:21:37,540
Chucky, you brave fool! Men 
like you are one of a kind!

417
00:21:37,880 --> 00:21:40,750
Guys... I'm counting on 
you to handle things here!

418
00:21:42,080 --> 00:21:42,880
Huh?

419
00:21:45,830 --> 00:21:47,460
He shook him off again!

420
00:21:46,420 --> 00:21:47,460
Oh no, Chucky!

421
00:21:48,420 --> 00:21:49,830
Your defense is too weak.

422
00:21:50,670 --> 00:21:51,330
Huh?

423
00:21:58,330 --> 00:22:01,080
WHAAAAAAT?!

424
00:23:31,040 --> 00:23:35,420
Ahiru no Sora
Next Time: Now...

425
00:23:31,710 --> 00:23:33,960
Next time: "Now..."

